<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech gets 350 mln ATS tram order.</title>
<headline>VA Tech gets 350 mln ATS tram order.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian engineering group VA Technologie said on Monday it was in a consortium of firms that had confirmed an order for a new range of trams to be delivered to Vienna's municipal transport authority.</p>
<p>VA Technologie's part of the order would be worth some 350 million schillings, it said.</p>
<p>The first ten of the new trams, built by VA Technologie's Elin Antriebstechnik unit together with SGP Verkehrstechnik and the Austrian unit of Germany's Siemens, would be delivered next year, the group said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
